  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Entomology class feature</p>\n<p>It's not exactly what happens in the wild, but it's a fairly good proxy if one assumes the gods are wanton children.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you choose not to feed a bug and allow it to starve to death, you may feed its remains to another bug as though it were an herbalism plant whose point value is equal to the dead bug's feed cost. Bug remains spoil and become inedible 24 hours after the bug's death.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/herbalism-feats#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
